scenarios/deathmatch_simple.wad

    The VizDoom scenario this exemplar records on, from the gameNgen-repro project
    (https://github.com/arnaudstiegler/gameNgen-repro), which is licensed under
    Apache-2.0.

    The .wad is a map-only PWAD: six lumps holding level geometry (UDMF TEXTMAP),
    a compiled BSP, and ACS scripts. It contains no graphics, sprites, sounds or
    flats — it references texture names that the base IWAD provides.

    The base IWAD is freedoom2.wad, which ships with the `vizdoom` package and is
    not redistributed here.
